{
  "$schema": "iswc-preview/v1",
  "tag": "iswc-sequence-diagram",
  "category": "diagrams",
  "title": "&lt;iswc-sequence-diagram&gt;",
  "titleHtml": false,
  "storageKey": "docs-iswc-sequence-diagram",
  "hasBehavior": true,
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "title": "Uso",
      "lede": [
        "Diagrama de secuencia en SVG, sin Mermaid. La configuración es un JSON",
        "          con actores, mensajes y grupos; el layout (posiciones, ruteo ortogonal",
        "          de las flechas y colocación de etiquetas) se calcula solo."
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<p>",
            "          Haz clic en el diagrama para abrir el visor a pantalla completa, con",
            "          controles de la animación tortuga, tooltips por paso y leyenda de",
            "          grupos que puedes encender y apagar.",
            "        </p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-sequence-diagram open-on-click>",
            "            <script type=\"application/json\">",
            "              { \"preset\": \"tk1437191\" }",
            "            </script>",
            "          </iswc-sequence-diagram>"
          ],
          "controls": [
            {
              "control": "boolean",
              "prop": "attr:open-on-click",
              "label": "open-on-click"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "json",
      "title": "json",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<h3>Configuración por JSON</h3>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<p>",
            "          Mismo esquema del proyecto original. <code class=\"code\">actors</code> define",
            "          las lifelines, <code class=\"code\">messages</code> los pasos y",
            "          <code class=\"code\">groups</code> el color por tono HSL (0–360).",
            "        </p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-sequence-diagram open-on-click>",
            "            <script type=\"application/json\">",
            "              {",
            "                \"sequence\": {",
            "                  \"title\": \"Facturación electrónica\",",
            "                  \"subtitle\": \"emisión · validación DIAN · acuse\",",
            "                  \"groups\": [",
            "                    { \"id\": \"g-emision\", \"name\": \"Emisión\", \"hue\": 239 },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"g-dian\", \"name\": \"Validación DIAN\", \"hue\": 199 },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"g-acuse\", \"name\": \"Acuse\", \"hue\": 38 }",
            "                  ],",
            "                  \"actors\": [",
            "                    { \"id\": \"E\", \"label\": \"{{iconify: {icon: \\\"mdi:store\\\", hue: 239}}} Empresa\", \"kind\": \"actor\" },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"C\", \"label\": \"{{iconify: {icon: \\\"mdi:file-document-outline\\\", hue: 199}}} ContaPyme\", \"kind\": \"participant\" },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"D\", \"label\": \"{{iconify: {icon: \\\"mdi:bank-outline\\\", hue: 38}}} DIAN\", \"kind\": \"participant\" }",
            "                  ],",
            "                  \"messages\": [",
            "                    { \"id\": \"s1\", \"group\": \"g-emision\", \"from\": \"E\", \"to\": \"C\", \"label\": \"Registra la venta\", \"step\": 1,",
            "                      \"log\": \"La empresa registra la venta\", \"desc\": \"El documento se arma con los datos del tercero y los ítems facturados.\" },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"s2\", \"group\": \"g-emision\", \"from\": \"C\", \"to\": \"C\", \"kind\": \"self\", \"label\": \"Genera XML · firma\", \"step\": 2,",
            "                      \"log\": \"Genera el XML y lo firma\", \"desc\": \"Se construye el **XML UBL** y se aplica la **firma digital** del emisor.\" },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"s3\", \"group\": \"g-dian\", \"from\": \"C\", \"to\": \"D\", \"label\": \"Envía documento\", \"step\": 3,",
            "                      \"log\": \"Envía el documento a la DIAN\" },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"s4\", \"group\": \"g-dian\", \"from\": \"D\", \"to\": \"C\", \"kind\": \"async\", \"label\": \"CUFE · estado\", \"step\": 4,",
            "                      \"log\": \"La DIAN responde con CUFE y estado\" },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"s5\", \"group\": \"g-acuse\", \"from\": \"C\", \"to\": \"E\", \"kind\": \"async\", \"label\": \"Factura validada\", \"step\": 5,",
            "                      \"log\": \"La factura queda validada\" }",
            "                  ]",
            "                }",
            "              }",
            "            </script>",
            "          </iswc-sequence-diagram>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "alt",
      "title": "alt",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<h3>Ramas <code class=\"code\">alt</code></h3>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<p>",
            "          Con <code class=\"code\">alt.branches</code> el diagrama encierra los pasos",
            "          condicionales en una caja punteada y rotula cada rama.",
            "        </p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-sequence-diagram open-on-click>",
            "            <script type=\"application/json\">",
            "              {",
            "                \"sequence\": {",
            "                  \"title\": \"Resolución del modelo por turno\",",
            "                  \"subtitle\": \"Clasificación operativa → MODELO en BD → respuesta final\",",
            "                  \"groups\": [",
            "                    { \"id\": \"g-clasif\", \"name\": \"Clasificación\", \"hue\": 215 },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"g-modelo\", \"name\": \"Resolución de modelo\", \"hue\": 210 },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"g-branch1\", \"name\": \"MODELO en fila\", \"hue\": 160 },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"g-branch2\", \"name\": \"Fallback\", \"hue\": 38 },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"g-epilogo\", \"name\": \"Registro\", \"hue\": 280 }",
            "                  ],",
            "                  \"actors\": [",
            "                    { \"id\": \"U\", \"label\": \"Usuario\", \"kind\": \"actor\", \"icon\": \"mdi:account\", \"hue\": 215 },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"P\", \"label\": \"PatyIA\", \"kind\": \"participant\", \"icon\": \"mdi:robot-outline\", \"hue\": 210 },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"O\", \"label\": \"OpenAI\", \"kind\": \"participant\", \"icon\": \"simple-icons:openai\", \"hue\": 160 }",
            "                  ],",
            "                  \"preamble\": [",
            "                    { \"id\": \"m1\", \"from\": \"U\", \"to\": \"P\", \"label\": \"Mensaje del usuario\", \"step\": 1, \"group\": \"g-clasif\" },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"m2\", \"from\": \"P\", \"to\": \"O\", \"label\": \"clasificar · PR_TIPO_CONSULTAS · gpt-4.1-nano\", \"step\": 2, \"group\": \"g-clasif\" },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"m3\", \"from\": \"O\", \"to\": \"P\", \"label\": \"tipo_consulta (JSON)\", \"kind\": \"async\", \"step\": 3, \"group\": \"g-clasif\" },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"m4\", \"from\": \"P\", \"to\": \"P\", \"label\": \"resolverPorTipo · MODELO en BD\", \"kind\": \"self\", \"step\": 4, \"group\": \"g-modelo\" }",
            "                  ],",
            "                  \"alt\": {",
            "                    \"branches\": [",
            "                      { \"condition\": \"MODELO en fila\",",
            "                        \"messages\": [{ \"id\": \"m5\", \"from\": \"P\", \"to\": \"O\", \"label\": \"responses.create(MODELO)\", \"step\": 5, \"group\": \"g-branch1\" }] },",
            "                      { \"condition\": \"fallback system-prompts\",",
            "                        \"messages\": [{ \"id\": \"m6\", \"from\": \"P\", \"to\": \"O\", \"label\": \"responses.create(modeloConversacion)\", \"step\": 6, \"group\": \"g-branch2\" }] }",
            "                    ]",
            "                  },",
            "                  \"epilogue\": [",
            "                    { \"id\": \"m7\", \"from\": \"O\", \"to\": \"P\", \"label\": \"respuesta\", \"kind\": \"async\", \"step\": 7, \"group\": \"g-epilogo\" },",
            "                    { \"id\": \"m8\", \"from\": \"P\", \"to\": \"P\", \"label\": \"log turno · modelo + tokens + costo\", \"kind\": \"self\", \"step\": 8, \"group\": \"g-epilogo\" }",
            "                  ]",
            "                }",
            "              }",
            "            </script>",
            "          </iswc-sequence-diagram>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nested",
      "title": "Subproceso (nested)",
      "lede": [
        "En la llegada de un mensaje, un recuadro con el proceso que esa acción inicia: el mismo nodo",
        "          kind: \"nested\" de los flujos (src o diagram, maxW/maxH, bg, title), vectorial y escalado contain."
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<p>",
            "          Agrega <code class=\"code\">nested</code> al mensaje. Con <code class=\"code\">src</code> se carga un JSON editable",
            "          (relativo a la página); <code class=\"code\">diagram</code> va inline. Por defecto 200 px por lado; fondo blanco en insoft.",
            "        </p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-sequence-diagram diagram-style=\"insoft\" open-on-click>",
            "            <script type=\"application/json\">",
            "              {",
            "                \"sequence\": {",
            "                  \"title\": \"Pedido con subprocesos\",",
            "                  \"actors\": [",
            "                    {",
            "                      \"id\": \"C\",",
            "                      \"label\": \"Cliente\"",
            "                    },",
            "                    {",
            "                      \"id\": \"A\",",
            "                      \"label\": \"API\"",
            "                    },",
            "                    {",
            "                      \"id\": \"B\",",
            "                      \"label\": \"Base de datos\"",
            "                    }",
            "                  ],",
            "                  \"messages\": [",
            "                    {",
            "                      \"id\": \"m1\",",
            "                      \"from\": \"C\",",
            "                      \"to\": \"A\",",
            "                      \"label\": \"POST /pedidos\",",
            "                      \"nested\": {",
            "                        \"title\": \"Validación del pedido\",",
            "                        \"maxW\": 220,",
            "                        \"diagram\": {",
            "                          \"tag\": \"iswc-flowchart\",",
            "                          \"payload\": {",
            "                            \"direction\": \"TB\",",
            "                            \"nodes\": [",
            "                              {",
            "                                \"id\": \"i\",",
            "                                \"label\": \"Inicio\",",
            "                                \"shape\": \"start\"",
            "                              },",
            "                              {",
            "                                \"id\": \"v\",",
            "                                \"label\": \"¿Datos completos?\",",
            "                                \"shape\": \"diamond\"",
            "                              },",
            "                              {",
            "                                \"id\": \"ok\",",
            "                                \"label\": \"Calcula totales\"",
            "                              },",
            "                              {",
            "                                \"id\": \"no\",",
            "                                \"label\": \"Responde 400\"",
            "                              },",
            "                              {",
            "                                \"id\": \"f\",",
            "                                \"label\": \"Fin\",",
            "                                \"shape\": \"end\"",
            "                              }",
            "                            ],",
            "                            \"edges\": [",
            "                              {",
            "                                \"from\": \"i\",",
            "                                \"to\": \"v\"",
            "                              },",
            "                              {",
            "                                \"from\": \"v\",",
            "                                \"to\": \"ok\",",
            "                                \"label\": \"sí\"",
            "                              },",
            "                              {",
            "                                \"from\": \"v\",",
            "                                \"to\": \"no\",",
            "                                \"label\": \"no\"",
            "                              },",
            "                              {",
            "                                \"from\": \"ok\",",
            "                                \"to\": \"f\"",
            "                              },",
            "                              {",
            "                                \"from\": \"no\",",
            "                                \"to\": \"f\"",
            "                              }",
            "                            ]",
            "                          }",
            "                        }",
            "                      }",
            "                    },",
            "                    {",
            "                      \"id\": \"m2\",",
            "                      \"from\": \"A\",",
            "                      \"to\": \"B\",",
            "                      \"label\": \"INSERT pedido\",",
            "                      \"nested\": {",
            "                        \"title\": \"Auditoría\",",
            "                        \"maxW\": 200,",
            "                        \"diagram\": {",
            "                          \"tag\": \"iswc-sequence-diagram\",",
            "                          \"payload\": {",
            "                            \"sequence\": {",
            "                              \"actors\": [",
            "                                {",
            "                                  \"id\": \"B\",",
            "                                  \"label\": \"BD\"",
            "                                },",
            "                                {",
            "                                  \"id\": \"L\",",
            "                                  \"label\": \"Log\"",
            "                                }",
            "                              ],",
            "                              \"messages\": [",
            "                                {",
            "                                  \"id\": \"x1\",",
            "                                  \"from\": \"B\",",
            "                                  \"to\": \"L\",",
            "                                  \"label\": \"registra cambio\"",
            "                                },",
            "                                {",
            "                                  \"id\": \"x2\",",
            "                                  \"from\": \"L\",",
            "                                  \"to\": \"B\",",
            "                                  \"label\": \"ok\",",
            "                                  \"kind\": \"reply\"",
            "                                }",
            "                              ]",
            "                            }",
            "                          }",
            "                        }",
            "                      }",
            "                    },",
            "                    {",
            "                      \"id\": \"m3\",",
            "                      \"from\": \"A\",",
            "                      \"to\": \"C\",",
            "                      \"label\": \"201 Created\",",
            "                      \"kind\": \"reply\"",
            "                    }",
            "                  ]",
            "                }",
            "              }",
            "            </script>",
            "          </iswc-sequence-diagram>"
          ],
          "controls": [
            {
              "control": "boolean",
              "prop": "attr:open-on-click",
              "label": "open-on-click"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "viewer",
      "title": "viewer",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<h3>Visor a pantalla completa</h3>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<p>",
            "          El visor se abre solo al hacer clic. También puedes montarlo tú mismo",
            "          con <code class=\"code\">&lt;iswc-diagram-lightbox&gt;</code> y controlarlo por",
            "          propiedades.",
            "        </p>",
            "        <p>",
            "          <button type=\"button\" id=\"openViewer\" class=\"demo-btn\">Abrir el visor</button>",
            "        </p>",
            "        <iswc-diagram-lightbox id=\"lb\" kind=\"sequence\"></iswc-diagram-lightbox>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "api",
      "title": "api",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<h3>Referencia</h3>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<h4>Atributos</h4>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "columns": [
            "Nombre",
            "Valores",
            "Descripción"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "<code class=\"code\">color</code>",
              "<code class=\"code\">inline</code> · <code class=\"code\">viewer</code>",
              "inline (default) es estático y abre el visor al hacer clic; viewer activa hover, tooltips, leyenda clickeable y auto-animación."
            ],
            [
              "<code class=\"code\">open-on-click</code>",
              "booleano",
              "Habilita abrir el visor a pantalla completa al hacer clic. Por defecto el componente no tiene visor."
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<h4>Propiedades</h4>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "columns": [
            "Nombre",
            "Descripción"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "<code class=\"code\">payload</code>",
              "Configuración JSON. Alternativa al <code class=\"code\">&lt;script type=\"application/json\"&gt;</code>."
            ],
            [
              "<code class=\"code\">spec</code>",
              "Spec resuelta (solo lectura)."
            ],
            [
              "<code class=\"code\">layout</code>",
              "Geometría calculada (solo lectura)."
            ],
            [
              "<code class=\"code\">turtle</code>",
              "API de la animación: play / pause / stop / next / prev."
            ],
            [
              "<code class=\"code\">hiddenGroups</code>",
              "Ids de grupos ocultos; al cambiar, el diagrama se re-diseña sin esas aristas."
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<h4>Eventos</h4>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "columns": [
            "Nombre",
            "detail",
            "Descripción"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "<code class=\"code\">iswc-turtle-state</code>",
              "<code class=\"code\">{playing, idx, total, replay}</code>",
              "Estado de la animación en cada avance."
            ],
            [
              "<code class=\"code\">iswc-open-viewer</code>",
              "<code class=\"code\">{payload}</code>",
              "Clic en la variante inline. <code class=\"code\">preventDefault()</code> evita que abra su propio visor."
            ],
            [
              "<code class=\"code\">iswc-toggle-group</code>",
              "<code class=\"code\">{id}</code>",
              "Clic en un grupo de la leyenda (solo en viewer)."
            ],
            [
              "<code class=\"code\">iswc-render</code>",
              "<code class=\"code\">{layout, svg}</code>",
              "El SVG terminó de construirse."
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<h4>Esquema del JSON</h4>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "columns": [
            "Campo",
            "Descripción"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "<code class=\"code\">actors[].id / label</code>",
              "Id referenciado por los mensajes y etiqueta. El label admite <code class=\"code\">{{iconify: {icon, hue}}}</code> al inicio, que se convierte en el avatar."
            ],
            [
              "<code class=\"code\">actors[].kind</code>",
              "<code class=\"code\">actor</code> o <code class=\"code\">participant</code>."
            ],
            [
              "<code class=\"code\">messages[].from / to</code>",
              "Ids de actor. Si coinciden, el paso se dibuja como self-loop."
            ],
            [
              "<code class=\"code\">messages[].kind</code>",
              "<code class=\"code\">sync</code> (default) · <code class=\"code\">async</code> (punteado) · <code class=\"code\">self</code>."
            ],
            [
              "<code class=\"code\">messages[].label</code>",
              "Título corto visible en el diagrama. Admite markdown inline e iconos."
            ],
            [
              "<code class=\"code\">messages[].log</code>",
              "Narración corta para el chip de la tortuga (≤70 caracteres visibles)."
            ],
            [
              "<code class=\"code\">messages[].desc</code>",
              "Descripción extendida para el tooltip. Si falta, usa <code class=\"code\">log</code>."
            ],
            [
              "<code class=\"code\">messages[].group</code>",
              "Id del grupo; define el color del paso."
            ],
            [
              "<code class=\"code\">groups[].hue</code>",
              "Tono HSL 0–360."
            ],
            [
              "<code class=\"code\">alt.branches[]</code>",
              "<code class=\"code\">{condition, messages[]}</code> — pasos condicionales dentro de una caja punteada."
            ],
            [
              "<code class=\"code\">preset</code>",
              "Spec predefinida: <code class=\"code\">tk1437191</code> o <code class=\"code\">tk1431662</code>. El <code class=\"code\">sequence</code> inline gana sobre el preset."
            ]
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "app-api",
      "title": "App API",
      "lede": "El mismo documento se abre en el visor o en el editor. El parámetro json no se reescribe al modificar el diagrama.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<p><a href=\"demos/diagramas/app/view.html?kind=sequence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Abrir visor</a> · <a href=\"demos/diagramas/app/edit.html?kind=sequence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Abrir editor</a></p>"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "ficha": {
    "sections": {
      "anatomia": {
        "content": [
          "Diagrama de secuencia en SVG, sin Mermaid. La configuración es un JSON",
          "          con actores, mensajes y grupos; el layout (posiciones, ruteo ortogonal",
          "          de las flechas y colocación de etiquetas) se calcula solo."
        ]
      },
      "ejemplos": {
        "content": [
          "```html",
          "<iswc-sequence-diagram open-on-click>",
          "            <script type=\"application/json\">",
          "              { \"preset\": \"tk1437191\" }",
          "            </script>",
          "          </iswc-sequence-diagram>",
          "```"
        ]
      }
    },
    "exclude": [
      "apiJs",
      "atributos",
      "eventos",
      "parts",
      "props",
      "slots",
      "states"
    ]
  }
}
